proposal = "Migrate journeys/engine.rs ReceiptMaterial, the real agent receipt producer and server decoder together to authenticated chain-state receipt keys and current rung evidence; preserve signature, inclusion-height, transaction and block commitment checks, and prove retrieval and reopen without caller-supplied AuthorizedBatch."
